# Project Context — Ikram System

Arabic charity / association operations platform for beneficiaries, staff, inventory, distribution, and governance reporting.

## Product domains

| Domain | Key models / areas |
|--------|--------------------|
| Beneficiaries | `Beneficiary`, dependents, categories, documents, OCR |
| Daily beneficiaries | `DailyBeneficiary`, documents, receiving, daily inventory |
| Staff | `Staff` / `StaffMember`, distributions, dependents |
| Organizations / reps | `Organization`, `NeighborhoodRep`, rep distributions & proofs |
| Warehouse | `InventoryItem`, movements, baskets |
| Distribution / delivery | `Distribution`, `DeliveryOrder`, `Driver`, receipts |
| Governance | Audit logs, PDF/Excel reports, settings, users & roles |
| Notifications | In-app notification center with permission-aware delivery |

## Repo layout

```
app/                  Laravel application (Models, Http, Services, …)
routes/api.php        Primary API surface (Sanctum + ModulePermission)
database/migrations   Schema source of truth
frontend/             React SPA (Vite)
resources/            Blade/views, legacy assets if any
tests/                PHPUnit + Browser helpers
docs/                 Design & testing strategy notes
.cursor/agents/       Specialist AI agent definitions
.cursor/rules/        Always-on orchestration & standards
```

## Non-negotiables

- **Permissions:** ModulePermission gates protected routes; UI must hide/disable unauthorized actions consistently with API 403s.
- **Data integrity:** Imports (smart Excel), soft deletes, and history must remain coherent.
- **Documents:** Uploads are separate records; do not invent replace-in-place endpoints without design.
- **Reports:** PDF (mPDF/dompdf) and Excel (PhpSpreadsheet) outputs are part of the product, not optional polish.
- **Locale:** Primary operators use Arabic RTL; keep labels and flows bilingual-safe where the app already is.
- **Test isolation:** Prefer disposable SQLite / `TEST_` prefixed records for browser and integration tests.

